Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Family politics gate: the full Forbidden Language list
 (U11)

The family devotions are held to CLAUDE.md's whole list
(scripts/lib/forbidden-language.mjs), not the politics gate's shorter
history-prose list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JuCQ8kZ25i9zRwNgk6bh4e
